_information.sql\"}, {\"name\": \"stg_loan_application\", \"unique_id\": \"model.dbt_loan_project.stg_loan_application\", \"database_name\": \"loan_database\", \"schema_name\": \"transformed\", \"table_name\": \"stg_loan_application\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"dbt_loan_project\", \"description\": \"Staging table for loan applications with deduplicated records. It contains information about loan application submissions and requested amounts.\", \"materialization\": \"view\", \"patch_path\": \"dbt_loan_project://models\\\\staging\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\staging\\\\stg_loan_application.sql\"}, {\"name\": \"stg_contact_information\", \"unique_id\": \"model.dbt_loan_project.stg_contact_information\", \"database_name\": \"loan_database\", \"schema_name\": \"transformed\", \"table_name\": \"stg_contact_information\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"dbt_loan_project\", \"description\": \"Staging table for storing applicant contact details, including address, phone number, and email.\", \"materialization\": \"view\", \"patch_path\": \"dbt_loan_project://models\\\\staging\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\staging\\\\stg_contact_information.sql\"}, {\"name\": \"stg_applicants\", \"unique_id\": \"model.dbt_loan_project.stg_applicants\", \"database_name\": \"loan_database\", \"schema_name\": \"transformed\", \"table_name\": \"stg_applicants\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"dbt_loan_project\", \"description\": \"Staging table for applicant information, including personal details such as name, date of birth, and gender. This table serves as a base for linking applicant-related information across the loan eligibility pipeline.\", \"materialization\": \"view\", \"patch_path\": \"dbt_loan_project://models\\\\staging\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\staging\\\\stg_applicants.sql\"}, {\"name\": \"trs_risk_assessment\", \"unique_id\": \"model.dbt_loan_project.trs_risk_assessment\", \"database_name\": \"loan_database\", \"schema_name\": \"transformed\", \"table_name\": \"trs_risk_assessment\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"dbt_loan_project\", \"description\": \"Transformed model that assesses and assigns risk tiers to applicants based on various credit, financial, and employment factors. The risk tier determines the likelihood of loan repayment.\", \"materialization\": \"view\", \"patch_path\": \"dbt_loan_project://models\\\\transformation\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\transformation\\\\trs_risk_assessment.sql\"}, {\"name\": \"trs_applicant_details\", \"unique_id\": \"model.dbt_loan_project.trs_applicant_details\", \"database_name\": \"loan_database\", \"schema_name\": \"transformed\", \"table_name\": \"trs_applicant_details\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"dbt_loan_project\", \"description\": \"Dimension table that consolidates key applicant details, including their age, derived from the date of birth. This table serves as the primary source of applicant identity and demographic information for downstream models.\", \"materialization\": \"view\", \"patch_path\": \"dbt_loan_project://models\\\\transformation\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\transformation\\\\trs_applicant_details.sql\"}, {\"name\": \"trs_employment_analysis\", \"unique_id\": \"model.dbt_loan_project.trs_employment_analysis\", \"database_name\": \"loan_database\", \"schema_name\": \"transformed\", \"table_name\": \"trs_employment_analysis\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"dbt_loan_project\", \"description\": \"This model consolidates and analyzes employment information for applicants, with an emphasis on calculating employment stability. The analysis helps assess the applicant's job stability.\", \"materialization\": \"view\", \"patch_path\": \"dbt_loan_project://models\\\\transformation\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\transformation\\\\tr